cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PoreWise, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PoreWise: permeability tensors of pore-scale images with the lattice Boltzmann method on GPU and CPU"
abstract: >-
  PoreWise computes the absolute permeability tensor of 2D and 3D binary images of porous
  materials. It solves creeping single-phase flow with the lattice Boltzmann method (BGK or
  two-relaxation-time collision) on a single GPU or on CPU cores, storing pore voxels only.
